cle:** Water is constantly recycled through the Earth in a closed system driven by the sun. It evaporates from oceans and lakes into the air, condenses into clouds, falls back to the ground as precipitation (rain or snow), and flows back into bodies of water.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Biological Importance (Water and Life)\nLife as"
